mpv_kit licensing
=================

* packages/**, tools/**, example/**  — MIT (see LICENSE).
* native/mpv/**  — mpv 0.41.0 source plus the mpv_kit patches in
  native/patches/. mpv is GPLv2+, with most files available under
  LGPLv2.1+ (see native/mpv/Copyright). mpv_kit's own additions to mpv
  (render_vk.h is ISC like mpv's other public headers; libmpv_vk.c is
  LGPLv2.1+).
* Binaries distributed by mpv_kit are built with -Dgpl=false against an
  LGPL FFmpeg and are dynamically linked, so applications using mpv_kit
  are not subject to the GPL. The full corresponding source (mpv, patches,
  build scripts, dependency versions) is this repository.
